Third-Party References
======================

This project was inspired by the architecture and design concepts of the
following open-source projects. No code was directly copied; all
implementations are clean-room based on publicly documented interfaces and
architectural ideas:

1. GK0421/cogalpha-factor-mining-clean
   - License: MIT
   - Relationship: Predecessor project (Stage18). This MVP is an independent
     rebuild with stricter sample isolation, a safe DSL (no eval/exec), and
     a reproducible pipeline architecture.

2. simonlin1212/global-stock-data
   - Reviewed for data normalization patterns only.

3. simonlin1212/a-stock-data
   - Reviewed for A-share data field conventions only.

4. HKUDS/Vibe-Trading
   - Reviewed for architectural patterns only.

The CogAlpha Operations Manual (PDF) served as a design reference for the
seven-level agent architecture, factor quality checking pipeline, and
out-of-sample validation methodology.
